  "body": "## Changelog\r\n\r\n* dc4846cea fix(test): wait for cluster usage metrics (#6054)\r\n* 7325ebff1 docs: fix broken MinIO LICENSE link and scope disableS3 to kURL (#6052)\r\n* 898fcf0df fix(ci): stop regression-test from being skipped on merges to main (#6050)\r\n* d8f4a9fe0 fix(kotsadm): add 60s timeout to GET /app/{slug}/updates upstream calls (#6051)\r\n* 63d3cf152 [deps] Dependency update: web (#6042)\r\n* a5ffd68a2 chore(deps): bump chainguard-dev/actions (#6048)\r\n* 6a284b0b9 chore(deps): upgrade troubleshoot to v0.134.0 and k8s libs to 1.37 (#6047)\r\n* f68fcbfd3 chore(deps): bump qs (#6046)\r\n\r\n"
